      "sourceAssessment": "Read the original Japanese HTML and independently retrieved the live page. It explicitly introduces actual line thickness, then gives standard diameter 50 lb 0.419 mm and 65 lb 0.447 mm. Exact table rows 1339729/1339730, UPC 022021600830/022021600847, establish the two 125-yard Moss Green SKUs. This is not a PE or mono-equivalent calculation. Dividing each published mm value by 25.4 is correct.",
