      "scope": "Original 2014 US Super Knot, Clear and Lo-Vis Green, all eight printed strengths on 220-yard fillers.",
      "numericBasis": "historical-manufacturer-inch-chart",
      "identityExact": true,
      "sourceAssessment": "Directly viewed page 4 of the original manufacturer catalog. The LEFT Super Knot table prints 4/6/8/10/12/14/17/20 lb and .008/.010/.012/.013/.014/.015/.017/.019 inch. Both color columns have availability dots and the filler legend says 4-20 lb, 220 yards. All eight mm conversions are correct.",
      "historicalVersionAssessment": "The archive manifest explicitly names Stren 2014 Catalog and identifies the original page assets. Branded original artwork and table are manufacturer material on an archive host, not an archive-authored specification table. Super Knot is distinct from neighboring MagnaThin and unproven later Power Knot equivalence.",
      "imageAssessment": "Directly viewed the lime-green/black Super Knot hero, matching the original page-4 package and asset identity. It is not turquoise MagnaThin.",
      "consumerCopyAssessment": "Self-lubricating mono is source-supported and framed as manufacturer positioning, not guaranteed knot performance. Historical US/date/color/package scope appears prominently. The actual 14/17 lb steps do not inherit the unsupported legacy 15 lb ID.",
      "acceptanceConditions": [
        "Preserve 2014 US and both-color/220-yard scope.",
        "Retain exclusion of stren-super-knot-monofilament-15; add the independently verified 4/14/17 lb IDs without relabeling 15 lb."
