      "verdict": "pass-2014-us-scope",
      "scope": "Original 2014 US FluoroCast Clear only; 4/6/8/10/12/15/17 lb, 100-yard pony and 200-yard filler.",
      "numericBasis": "historical-manufacturer-inch-chart",
      "identityExact": true,
      "sourceAssessment": "Directly viewed page 6. The LEFT FluoroCast table prints .007/.009/.010/.012/.013/.015/.016 inch for 4/6/8/10/12/15/17 lb. Clear dots and separate 4-17 lb pony 100 yd/filler 200 yd legends support both lengths for every row. All seven mm conversions are correct.",
      "historicalVersionAssessment": "2014 edition manifest and original page assets establish the archived edition. The right-hand Stren 100% Fluoro chart is a different family with a different strength/diameter map; its 20 lb entry is not transferred.",
      "imageAssessment": "Directly viewed the gray/black FluoroCast hero, including its 100% Fluorocarbon printing. It matches the left-hand product, not the neighboring blue 100% Fluoro package.",
      "consumerCopyAssessment": "100% fluorocarbon mainline identity is supported. The 100-yard pony package does not misclassify it as leader-only. Copy preserves Clear/2014 US, excludes 20 lb and avoids an unchanged-formulation or current-stock claim.",
      "acceptanceConditions": [
        "Retain exclusion of stren-fluorocast-fluorocarbon-20 and preserve its 4 lb new ID.",
        "Retain both 100/200-yard mappings as historical, not current availability; do not import the neighboring 100% Fluoro table."
      ],
